  - \(xi+1 \cdot yi\): \(0 \cdot 3 + 0 \cdot 0 + 4 \cdot 0 + 0 \cdot 3 = 0 + 0 + 0 + 0 = 0\)
- Calculate the area:
  \[
  \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \left| 12 - 0 \right| = \frac{1}{2} \times 12 = 6
  \]

